T RECEIPT] ${TIMESTAMP}\\n- **Agent**: \\`${AGENT}\\`\\n- **Beat**: \\`${BEAT_UPPER}\\`\\n- **Payload**: \\\"${MESSAGE}\\\"\" >> \"$CATCH_LOG\"\nfi\n","Description":"Hard Runtime Speech Beat Gate in 100% Pure Bash","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/agent_beat_gate.sh","toolAction":"Writing pure bash agent_beat_gate.sh script","toolSummary":"Write pure bash agent_beat_gate.sh"}}]}
